## Lemma Target
Audited finite form:
  hard mirror-orbit debt and current-cut failure intersect in exactly
  one row, random_covering_031.
  Seven of the eight hard mirror orbits, on six of the seven hard rows,
  already have a separating E/branch boundary-current exit.
  The AP84 packet has no hard orbit debt; its two nonseparating base rows
  remain AP sidecar debt rather than hard-orbit debt.
Proof pull:
  hard_orbit_discharge <= separating_current_transfer + random031_clause.
  boundary-current exceptions not named random031 should be handled as
  low-delta owner-current/two-adic/SPEC/state-lift debt, not as hard
  mirror-orbit debt.

